{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_06_end",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_06",
  "title": "厭食",
  "storyCode": "SV-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e490f52b318091d7571a701bef274cfc63ea3d09c40ef74de10eec0e44bbf374",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咳咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......對象是人的話，力道和角度很難控制。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "沒、沒事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（嗅了嗅自己）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是不流血了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它們為什麼還這麼興奮？這裡的恐魚本來就這麼多嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是昨天那種怪物嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我以前沒見過哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這幾天你們不要到這裡來了。快回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......不要拽我的裙子。你不是那麼小的小孩子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我是想說......我想好我要什麼了。我想聽你唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "因為......我不知道什麼是歌。我聽到你在夢裡哼了。但我聽不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你答應了？這是不是就是約定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（皺眉）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我的琴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？是啊，歌手，你的琴去哪裡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......我回去找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "好，我幫你一起找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這是不是說，你願意跟我一起回去啦？太、太好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "真的......值得這麼高興？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "嗨，牆灰，早上好呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "對啊，鐵皮去哪裡了？你們之前一直形影不離啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你盯著的方向......是海......嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "難道說，昨天抽到紅色貝殼的人，是鐵皮？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "木框，我的病好像更嚴重了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我的胸口很漲，像是要爆開一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我連東西都不想吃。你不要和我說話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，歡迎再次來到我們家！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "呃......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你奶奶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶還在休息呢。昨天我們一起回到這裡，她就一直躺著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我想，她也消耗了很大體力，肯定很累了。我沒想到她會衝出來，對審判官那樣說話。她變得和平時都不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你說的對。她很......厲害。她打退了審判官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "呵......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "打退了......審判官？！歌手，你這麼說，要是讓審判官聽見，她一定又要生氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "隨便她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "要是她想再動手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她不會再來找你麻煩了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......找誰的麻煩都一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（摸箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "對了，我們出去找琴吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你頭上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哇！好多綠色的黏黏的東西......這、這是什麼東西呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是海藻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是剛才摔跤時候蹭到的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "大概。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這些......有用嗎？看起來和海草長得差不多。能不能等風吹乾了拿來鋪床？佩特拉奶奶腰不舒服，正好用得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你用貝殼將這些海藻磨碎。不要洗掉這些粘液。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "加上一點海水，記得沒過海藻。裝進這個小罐子裡，封好口。放半年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "等罐子裡的液體的綠色淡了，說明發酵好了，就可以喝啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......歌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怎麼了？是不是沒聽明白？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你......你好像從來沒一口氣對我說過這麼多話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "貝殼也不用扔，洗淨曬乾，當喝酒的容器用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "酒？那是什麼東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那裡寫著。這裡原先是所酒吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "原來這個字是酒的意思！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "他們說喝酒能帶來快樂，忘記煩惱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不過，味道還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你以前經常喝這個嗎？在你的家鄉......阿戈爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不大一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......有時候會一起喝類似的，在跳舞之前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你們那時候一定很快樂。噢，我明白啦！不是酒能帶來快樂，是快樂的時候，我們喝酒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "生活在外面的人，呃，是不是都會喝酒？大家是不是都很快樂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "未必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我懂了。那他們一定沒有我現在這麼快樂。歌手，謝謝你教我做這個酒。我真想馬上就和你一起喝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你的手勢錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這麼碾的話，很難碾碎。你可以換個角度，用最尖的部分對準海藻的紋理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "掌握韻律，調整呼吸......令你的手，你的身體，與觸到你肌膚的海風融為一體。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "像這樣——一擊，即碎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你盯著我，是還想動手嗎？只有你一個人的話，結束得很快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "不......沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "這個，還給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這是我的琴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "是鐵皮撿到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "他昨天夜裡看到你把這東西掉在了外面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哎呀，太好了！歌手，我們不用去找琴了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮他，他把這東西偷偷拿回了我們住的房子，讓我......讓我把它給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "說完這個他就走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "啊？啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（撥琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這個調子......咦，是你晚上睡著時候哼著的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它經常在我腦子裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這是你和你的同伴，你們以前會唱的歌嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "在家的時候，這樣的歌還有很多。我們用歌聲......對彼此說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "離開以後，其他歌聲都消失了。我一個人，只剩下這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "難怪，這首歌聽起來很讓人難過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（撥琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，我們的約定！你拿回了琴，是不是可以為我們唱歌了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我們可都等著哩，是吧，佩特拉奶奶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "唔......呃啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "奶奶今天說不出話了。不然她一定也想跟著唱哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "啊......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，佩特拉奶奶想聽呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個獵人他走上海岸♪\n他的家鄉在後，他的路在身前♪\n父母與兒女都與他失散♪\n他的戀人已經葬身大海♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你的表情有一絲變化。你是否感受到了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "沒什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "並不意外，你的神經依舊遲鈍。看看你面前的這些水。水位的起伏，波紋的頻率，光澤的躍動。這些都是訊息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "快要漲潮了。我們該上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個獵人他走上海岸♪\n他的家鄉在後，徒餘哀歎♪\n他的路沒有盡頭♪\n他的路濃霧彌漫♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官",
      "text": "她在唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官",
      "text": "她竟然，在這個破房子裡，在這些人面前唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官",
      "text": "這些人......他們也竟然在聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官",
      "text": "低著頭的人依然低著頭。不會說話的人依然凍著舌頭。歌聲明明沒法進到他們僵硬的軀殼裡。可他們的眼睛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官",
      "text": "他們，聽懂了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她......睡著了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我很少見她睡得這麼安穩。以前她一閉眼就會大叫，在空氣裡亂抓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我還以為聽見你唱歌，她會想要跳舞。她總是嚷嚷著想跳舞哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "牆灰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我要死了。我的眼睛......進了海水。好鹹，一點都不好喝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哇，你這是......你是不是哭了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "哭？什麼是哭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......是從你身體深處流淌出來的情緒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "這樣......嗎？我還是不大明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，我喜歡你的歌。你不愛說話，可是你的歌裡有許多話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你願意再唱一遍嗎？我想聽你說更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（撥琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "吃的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "有吃的到了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "去海灘上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "教士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
